  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "交通肇事鑑定實務",
    "sub_ename": "ACCIDENT INVESTIGATION & RECONSTRUCTION PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "交通肇事鑑定實務係一門實用的課程，其目的在介紹事故的處理，跡證的搜集，鑑定制度，事故原因分析與歸責方法，透過實際案例的鑑定分析加以印證說明，進而達到肇事預防與交通安全的需求。",
    "describe_eh": "Accident investigation & reconstruction practice is a practical course. The purpose of this course is twofold: 1. To introduce the procedure of accident investigation, Evidence Collection, expert investigation accident reconstruction & course analysis. 2. To achieve the goal of accident prevention & improve the transportation safe facility standard.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
